    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000030",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "**Br**<sub>**2**</sub>** (aq) + 2e**<sup>**- **</sup>**⇌ 2Br**<sup>**-**</sup>** (aq)        *****E***<sup>**ꝋ**</sup>** = +1.09 V**",
    "reading_order" : 30,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "paragraph",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000031",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "**2H**<sup>**+**</sup>** (aq) + 2e**<sup>**- **</sup>**⇌ H**<sub>**2**</sub>** (g)        *****E***<sup>**ꝋ**</sup>** = 0.00 V   **",
    "reading_order" : 31,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "paragraph",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000032",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "The Br<sub>2 </sub>/ Br<sup>-</sup> half-cell is the **positive pole** and the H<sup>+ </sup>/ H<sub>2</sub> is the **negative** pole",
    "reading_order" : 32,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
