    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "The *E*<sub>*cell*</sub><sup>ꝋ </sup>is: ***E***<sub>***cell***</sub><sup>**ꝋ**</sup>** = (+ 1.09) - (0.00) = + 1.09 V**",
    "reading_order" : 33,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
