  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000043",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "**MnO**<sub>**4**</sub><sup>**-**</sup>** (aq) + 8H**<sup>**+**</sup>** (aq) + 5e**<sup>**- **</sup>**⇌ Mn**<sup>**2+**</sup>** (aq) + 4H**<sub>**2**</sub>**O (l)       *****E***<sup>**ꝋ**</sup>** = +1.52 V**",
    "reading_order" : 43,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "paragraph",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000044",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "**2H**<sup>**+**</sup>** (aq) + 2e**<sup>**- **</sup>**⇌ H**<sub>**2**</sub>** (g)       *****E***<sup>**ꝋ **</sup>**= 0.00 V   **",
    "reading_order" : 44,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "paragraph",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000045",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "The H<sup>+</sup> ions are also present in the half-cell as they are required to convert MnO<sub>4</sub><sup>- </sup>into Mn<sup>2+ </sup>ions",
    "reading_order" : 45,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000046",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "The MnO<sub>4</sub><sup>- </sup>/ Mn<sup>2+</sup> half-cell is the **positive pole** and the H<sup>+ </sup>/ H<sub>2</sub> is the **negative** pole",
    "reading_order" : 46,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
    "source_engine_version" : "1.0.0"
  }, {
    "element_id" : "e000047",
    "element_type" : "text_block",
    "page_number" : 1,
    "bounding_box" : null,
    "text" : "The *E*<sub>*cell*</sub><sup>ꝋ</sup> is ***E***<sub>***cell***</sub><sup>**ꝋ**</sup>** = (+ 1.52) - (0.00) = + 1.52 V**",
    "reading_order" : 47,
    "confidence" : 1.0,
    "role" : "list_item",
    "heading_level" : null,
    "source_engine" : "sme-revision-note",
